{title: Lagi Aaj Saawan Ki Phir Woh Jhadi Hai}
{artist: Chandni Suresh Wadkar}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [C] [D],        Lagi aaj sawan ki phir woh jhadi hai
[C] [Am] [Em],        Lagi aaj sawan ki phir woh jhadi hai
[Em] [C] [D]
Wohi aag phir seene mein phir jal padi hai
[C] [Am] [Em],        Lagi aaj sawan ki phir woh jhadi hai
[D] [Am]
Kuchh aise hi din the woh jab hum mile the
[G] [D] [Em],        Chaman mein nahi phool dil mein khile the
[Em] [Am] [Bm],        Wohi to hai mausam magar rut nahin woh
[A] [D] [Em],        Mere saath barsaat bhi ro padi hai
[D] [Am],        Koi kash dil pe zara hath rakh de
[G] [D] [Em],        Mere dil ke tukdon ko ek sath rakh de
[Em] [Am] [Bm],        Magar yeh hain khwabon khyalon ki baatein
[A] [D] [Em],        Kabhi toot kar cheez koi judi hai
